zhi-064-suncong-complete:p014:m0233","mention_ids":["c-sanguozhi-064-suncong-complete:p014:m0233"],"kind":"paragraph"}],"mention_count":3,"duplicate_mention_count":0,"paragraph_occurrence_count":3,"table_occurrence_count":0,"passage_count":3,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers_not_independent_witness_passages","count_explanation":"3處獨立位置，3個原始錨點；0項為同底本同位置重出。頻次不是來源權威度。"}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-sanguozhi-064-suncong-complete-ws2263487"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"independent_fixed_witness_occurrences","raw_mentions_preserved":true,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers","explanation":"頻次依已驗同底本同位置去重；原始錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-064-suncong-complete:p006:m0065","surface":"闓","start":65,"end":66,"kind":"person","person_id":"ndv_fse_wwd","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-064-suncong-complete:p006","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-064-suncong-complete"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-064-suncong-complete:p011:m0369","surface":"闓","start":369,"end":370,"kind":"person","person_id":"ndv_fse_wwd","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-064-suncong-complete:p011","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-064-suncong-complete"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-064-suncong-complete:p014:m0233","surface":"闓","start":233,"end":234,"kind":"person","person_id":"ndv_fse_wwd","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-064-suncong-complete:p014","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-064-suncong-complete"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-sanguozhi-064-suncong-complete-6-61","title":"長水校尉","kind":"office","mode":"attestation","person_id":"ndv_fse_wwd","attestations":[{"id":"th-sanguozhi-064-suncong-complete-6-61:a","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-064-suncong-complete:p006","start":61,"end":65,"surface":"長水校尉","person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-064-suncong-complete:p006:m0065","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-064","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-064-suncong-complete","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-064-suncong-complete-ws2263487","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-064-suncong-complete:p006","quote":"　　綝以孫亮始親政事，多所難問，甚懼。還建業，稱疾不朝。築室幹朱雀橋南，使弟威遠將軍據入蒼龍宿衛，弟武衛將軍恩、偏將軍幹、長水校尉闓分屯諸營，欲以專朝自固。亮內嫌綝，乃推魯育見殺本末，責怒虎林督朱熊、熊弟外部督朱損不匡正孫峻，乃令丁奉殺熊於虎林，殺損於建業。綝入諫不從，亮遂與公主魯班、太常全尚、將軍劉承議誅綝。亮妃，綝從姊女也，以其謀告綝。綝率眾夜襲全尚，遣弟恩殺劉承於蒼龍門外，遂圍宮。使光祿勳盂宗告廟廢亮，召群司儀曰：「少帝荒病昏亂，不可以處大位，承宗廟，以告先帝廢之。諸君若有不同者，下異議。」皆震怖。曰：「唯將軍令。」綝遣中書郎李祟奪亮璽綬，以亮罪狀班告遠近。尚書桓彝不肯署名，綝怒殺之。","person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-064-suncong-complete:p006:m0065"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"所見原官稱，未載全任期。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-064-suncong-complete:p006","text":"　　綝以孫亮始親政事，多所難問，甚懼。還建業，稱疾不朝。築室幹朱雀橋南，使弟威遠將軍據入蒼龍宿衛，弟武衛將軍恩、偏將軍幹、長水校尉闓分屯諸營，欲以專朝自固。亮內嫌綝，乃推魯育見殺本末，責怒虎林督朱熊、熊弟外部督朱損不匡正孫峻，乃令丁奉殺熊於虎林，殺損於建業。綝入諫不從，亮遂與公主魯班、太常全尚、將軍劉承議誅綝。亮妃，綝從姊女也，以其謀告綝。綝率眾夜襲全尚，遣弟恩殺劉承於蒼龍門外，遂圍宮。使光祿勳盂宗告廟廢亮，召群司儀曰：「少帝荒病昏亂，不可以處大位，承宗廟，以告先帝廢之。諸君若有不同者，下異議。」皆震怖。曰：「唯將軍令。」綝遣中書郎李祟奪亮璽綬，以亮罪狀班告遠近。尚書桓彝不肯署名，綝怒殺之。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":84,"last_line":84,"raw_start":11354,"raw_end":12118,"raw_character_offsets":[11354,11355,11356,11357,11358,11359,11360,11361,11362,11363,1136